    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d602">

                <pb facs="0666" n="654" xml:id="pg654"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.001 Vargas, Getulio/134⅔</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Roosevelt to the Under
                        Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-01-08">January 8, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I merely told Martins that if I went to the West Indies this Winter I hoped much
                    President Vargas could meet me in some central location like Trinidad. Nothing
                    further.</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
